! The sword lesson

Read [[Reading/The Master's Book]] without looking at the translation first.

''Focus:''
# How is 一本书 (yì běn shū) assembled?
# What is the object of 喜欢 (xǐhuan)?
# What does the master teach?
# How does the double-object example connect to [[Grammar/SVO Word Order]]?

